The '''Wand of Healing''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Healing Wand]] and [[Support items|Support Item]]. It can be upgraded into the {{Item|Wand of Mending}}, followed by the {{Item|Wand of Restoration}} and {{Item|Wand of Atonement}}. It can only be crafted and used after reaching {{Coll|Zombie Slayer 1}}.

