{{YouTube|7wFhaA9x2aQ|caption=Wand of Healing Demonstration}}

== Trivia ==
* Although consecutive casts do not stack, the first healing tick is applied immediately. With enough {{Stat|Vitality}}, repeatedly casting the ability can heal {{Stat|hp|120}} per second.

